//# iOS Screenshot Protection Demo

//# Overview
//This is a demo iOS project created to explore and implement screenshot protection techniques in iOS applications using Swift and UIKit.

//The project focuses purely on testing secure UI approaches and understanding platform limitations.



//#  Features

//-  Screenshot protection using secure text field layering
//-  Experimental setup for testing iOS security behavior
//-  Lightweight and focused implementation
//-  UIKit-based UI


//# Tech Stack

//- Swift
//- UIKit
//- Xcode


//# What This Project Demonstrates

//- How to obscure sensitive UI content during screenshots
//- How iOS handles secure rendering layers
//- Practical implementation of screenshot protection techniques


//# Important Note

//iOS does not provide an official API to completely block screenshots.
//This project demonstrates **workarounds** and **best-effort protection techniques**, not guaranteed prevention.

